OL,3,AKit Harington joins HBO's Harry Potter
OL,4,Aseries as Gilderoy Lockhart
OL,5,
OL,6,FKit Harington has been tapped to join
OL,7,Fthe highly anticipated Harry Potter TV
OL,8,Fseries, as the wizarding world's
OL,9,Fcelebrity-turned-Hogwarts instructor
OL,10,FGilderoy Lockhart, HBO confirmed to the
OL,11,FBBC.
OL,13,FHarington is replacing actor Nicholas
OL,14,FHoult who could not film season two of
OL,15,Fthe series due to a scheduling
OL,16,Fconflict.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
